[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4155.3, "timestamp": "01:09:15", "text": "呃，怎么办啊，兄弟？哦，这下糟了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4184.789, "timestamp": "01:09:44", "text": "他们。我该怎么办？我想问问他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4189.059, "timestamp": "01:09:49", "text": "实际上，我想问问他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4190.51, "timestamp": "01:09:50", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4194.229, "timestamp": "01:09:54", "text": "嗯，我想问问他们关于比利·比利的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4197.47, "timestamp": "01:09:57", "text": "限制以及哪些行为是允许的，哪些行为是不允许的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4198.9, "timestamp": "01:09:58", "text": "允许。"}]